## Running the suite

Execute all tests from the repository root:

```bash
bats tests/
```

Run a single suite:

```bash
bats tests/health-check.bats
```

Run with ShellCheck as a pre-test gate:

```bash
shellcheck -x -S error tests/*.sh && bats tests/
